{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_blitz_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_blitz_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "團隊堅盾",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_blitz_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3a55b4142872385baceb887df732f7acb7ab7db75ead5fe9d4a4c0723a4c122d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薩爾貢\n焚風熱土邊境"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閃一邊去，沒力氣跟你說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您能賣些水和吃的給我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（瞇眼觀察BLITZ）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喲，原來是雇傭兵老爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們村裡除了熱風和沙子外什麼都沒有，你來幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我準備去南方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去南方？哈，我看你是熱昏了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可是焚風熱土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是去焚風熱土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（重新打量了一遍BLITZ）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看你精神不錯，沒受什麼打擊，去那尋死幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是去看看，探索一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜猜，其他人是不是把你當瘋子趕走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你找我幹什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "買些補給。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傭兵大爺啊，在這村裡一口水一口糧都是命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錢可不好用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽其他村民說，你負責跟別村的人做生意，沒錯吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，誰會來這種地方買東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（薩爾貢俚語）我想買“三枚金幣”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不通順的維多利亞語）我需要蛋糕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（薩爾貢俚語）給你一粒黃沙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "屋裡說話吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_safehouseindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎來到羅德島安全屋，幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，你們這群人是叫幹員，對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要些什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盡可能多的乾糧和水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真要進焚風熱土？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在這鬼地方待了四十多年，從來沒見人會對那地方感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從那裡刮來的熱風每年都會帶走不少人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於剩下的，你也看到了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每天在門外一動不動吹風乘涼，說句話都嫌累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是我還會做點買賣，和外面有那麼點接觸，我這輩子也就那樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但去看一眼總歸沒什麼損失，對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就你們外鄉人會感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等下，我這有個之前你們羅德島的人留下的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你先喝口水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一次有人委託我弄這個什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（口音濃重的維多利亞語）“安全屋”的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們給想要去熱土的人留了份須知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不識字，你自己看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（標準維多利亞語）不建議探索焚風熱土，若一定要進入請務必確認帶足生存資源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這上面寫了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "建議我帶足補給再進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不知道你為什麼那麼固執，要去那鬼地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然這樣吧，水和物資我這裡有，按照那什麼規定本來就是要給你們幹員的，你自己拿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛的水喝了沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼感覺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "頭好像不那麼脹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就對囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這東西我會放一水壺，你覺得頭不舒服了就喝一口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但別一口氣喝太多，會產生幻覺的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一共一枚金幣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一枚金幣？好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃？不，兄弟我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我回來的時候可能得麻煩你買隻馱獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可這——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再買些回程的補給，剩下還有多的就麻煩你隨便買些特產了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧好吧，外鄉人花錢都很闊啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在這睡一晚還是有其他安排？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在就出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧兄弟，我也不留你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，怎麼稱呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "BLITZ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_laccolith"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "焚風熱土，BLITZ薩爾貢之旅的最後一站。\n迎接他的是炎熱、狂風與沙粒。\n對於泰拉人而言，無盡黃沙，熾熱風暴，那就是大地盡頭的樣貌。\n但在BLITZ眼中，它卻是探索的起點，只要足夠堅韌，再加上一些好運氣，它或許會為探險家展現真相。\n既然這片沙漠尚無人探索，這裡就擁有些微小的可能性。\n萬一其中包含了回家的方法呢？\nBLITZ決定試一試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這樣，我進入了熱土，然後完好無損地回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勇氣可嘉，兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我應該對泰拉各個危險區域做過重點標註。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們倒是好，全部去了個遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，焚風熱土有什麼發現嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很希望自己能說出些好消息，但那個地方只有沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "TACHANKA、FROST，我聽說北方冰原那裡有很多怪東西，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "FROST對付過那些怪物，很難纏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真希望能和些有形的東西戰鬥，至少能證實那裡還有生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但在焚風熱土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天空、狂風、沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是一切了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那裡應該不太適合旅遊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很無趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "也很孤單，BLITZ這樣想到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話說，你跑到薩爾貢探險，有去拜訪我們的老朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……你是說長泉鎮的新領主小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她最近過得還不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "處理完那些煩人的怪物之後，新的哥倫比亞公司找上了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽起來不像是什麼好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅蘭德？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅蘭德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對方給出了很優渥的條件，但因為之前沃爾沃特科欽斯基鬧出的麻煩，皮加爾還是拒絕了許多條款，只確定了最基本的貿易合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長泉鎮之前的資金來源主要是出售源石礦，但深層礦場早已封閉，淺層礦場也在那時候被我們爆破，不存在繼續出產礦石的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們還能販賣什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這還得感謝我們的亞歷山大先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我有什麼關係？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在那裡閒著無聊，做了許多俄羅斯娃娃吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說去考察的哥倫比亞人很喜歡這種“薩爾貢”工藝品，梅蘭德的人找皮加爾要了獨家代理權。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這太荒唐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當地人搖身一變，全成了薩爾貢的“傳統”手藝人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後領主小姐拿這第一桶金找哥倫比亞人買了適宜在荒漠生長的糧食種子，還把鎮子翻新了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "順便一提，老領主的宅子被皮加爾修成花園了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以我們的眼光來看，她做得還不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——米亞羅醫生的墓，還在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……墓石一直在被風沙侵蝕，已經有些崩落了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我幫他擦了墓碑，獻了一束花，然後請當地人做了個小防風棚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想他在另外一個世界過得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那很不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整體來說，薩爾貢是個有趣的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們的語言發展情況，和我去過的其他國家都大不相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使是同一個地區的人，都會因為種族差異而帶有不同的口音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些音調只在特定的種族中出現，其他種族的人幾乎沒有重複出現的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除非，他們變成蜥蜴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或是其他什麼奇怪生物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的關注點很特別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我的專業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說到語言，我在薩爾貢經過了一個很特別的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿卡胡拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿……卡……呼……啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是阿卡胡拉，醫療部那位阿達克利斯小姐的老家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，我聽說過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒想到在薩爾貢還能找到這樣一個天堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜，那裡的阿達克利斯“熱情過度”，能用拳頭交流都懶得動口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後盾牌使用頻率過高，碰！壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在離開阿卡胡拉前，我只能暫時用木材加閃光彈製造了一塊盾牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雨林裡有不少獨特的獵物，蒂娜你會喜歡那裡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用餐時間差不多到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位下午有什麼安排？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想我可能得去人事部搞套新制服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩爾貢的沙子算是把整套制服都毀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再穿著它，我甚至無法隱蔽自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是個人都能沿著一路落下的沙礫找到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是災難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，兩小時後，羅德島訓練場集合，各位沒有意見吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已經很久沒有作為一支小隊進行日常訓練了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望各位還記得對抗演習的重點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解散，兩小時後見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚點見，各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行動起來吧，科茨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天還有許多任務等待著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅德島\n虹彩小隊臨時宿舍"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新制服、新裝備，這下就差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我看看——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "BLITZ看著宿舍鏡子中的自己。\n在這段時間裡，他獨自一人遊歷薩爾貢，尋找著回家的線索。\n從薩爾貢或繁榮或頹廢的城市，到阿卡胡拉茂密的叢林，沒有地方能阻攔他探索的腳步。\n但焚風熱土是個例外。\n在那裡，似乎時間都被黃沙支配。\n一天，兩天，十天。\n眼前的景色從來沒有改變過。\n就那麼在沙中踏步。\n一無所獲。\n他害怕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他也不清楚自己是何時下定決心返回的，在那段時間裡，前進與後退似乎沒有區別。\n直到回到那個熱土邊境的安全屋時，生存的知覺才回到身體上。\n緊接著，就是如潮水般湧來的疲憊。\n每次想起，都感到害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣，狀態還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等下請你子彈吃個夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我先過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（拍拍BLITZ的肩膀）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "熟悉的聲音把他從回憶拉回現實。\n他看著自己手中那把改造銃，還有充滿電能的盾牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對抗演習，應該是我和ASH對付FROST和TACHANKA吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "合作，對抗，與戰友共同達成戰術目標。\n他突然覺得心中充滿了幹勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該給他們個驚喜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_trainingcom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "四小時後\n羅德島本艦訓練場"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，哈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "曾經那麼一刻，他想過把探索熱土的路走到盡頭。不成功便成仁。\n但在某一天，多喝了一口安全屋兄弟送的神秘飲料，處於清醒與迷幻的間隙中時，他突然意識到一點：\n自己舉盾衝刺，迫切地想要獲得成果。\n卻把自己的隊友們遠遠甩在了身後。\n艾力亞斯·科茨，幹員BLITZ。\n職責是護衛隊友。\n為FROST創造佈陷機會。\n把敵人引向TACHANKA的槍前。\n給ASH提供一些建議。\n而非一人獨行，涉險探索。\n他明白了。\n所以現在，他回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我都快忘記上一次踩中踏墊是什麼感覺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝天謝地，FROST，你沒有拿對付怪物的陷阱對付我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把感謝留給ASH吧，沒有那發榴彈你本該出局的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這畢竟只是二對二對抗訓練，許多要素要比實際情況簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亞歷山大的設防位置我已經用無人機確認過多次，所以才敢冒險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果使用的不是訓練彈，你沒有機會的，ASH。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我鑽了這個空子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望我們四個一下子消失，沒把ELA、IANA她們一起捲進來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但願如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很可惜，我們再也沒辦法湊成一支完整的五人特種小隊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有沒有考慮過在這片大地上招募點新人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是反恐特種部隊成員，不是軍事承包商手底下的雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維護和平是，曾經是，我們唯一的任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很可惜，這裡的和平比地球的還要脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，現在我們要做的，是生存，還有尋找回家的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論有多少新鮮血液，他們都不會和我們一起把這條路走到盡頭的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這種差別，真的有那麼大嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比我們各自的國家之間的區別還要大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前有老上司六號幫我們擦屁股，現在呢，一切都看我們自己的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許你可以嘗試著讓自己融入這個世界，ASH。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們離開熟悉的環境很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但適應這裡之後，或許會覺得這個糟糕的地方，可能還有些可取之處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回家很重要，但那不是全部，寇恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在找到回家的路之前，或許可以先想想，怎麼去生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣可以讓我們放下槍之後，還能行走在這片大地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是你的想法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一個建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來自朋友的建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會考慮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好久不見，虹彩小隊的各位幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，ASH，這是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們也是來訓練的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "法倫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者說，是來接受訓練的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格瑞斯",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然新的對手就位了，那讓我們開始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ASH，你不會是想……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是幹員，我們是虹彩小隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望各位能夠接受這場挑戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我得換種踏墊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢，BLITZ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "答案顯而易見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拒絕可不是我的選項，ASH。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我準備好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
